---
globs: **/.env,**/.env.*,**/*.env
alwaysApply: false
---
# .env / environment files

- Never insert real secrets. Use placeholders (e.g., `YOUR_API_KEY_HERE`) and explain where values come from.
- Add new vars in a grouped, readable way; keep names consistent with existing conventions.
- If a new env var is required, also update lightweight Markdown docs when asked (Filename: `*.md`) or note it in the response.
- Don’t duplicate vars; prefer a single source of truth per environment.
